    {
      "title": "Dynamic Rendering Triggered by Request APIs",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Dynamic Rendering Triggered by Request APIs",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What makes a route dynamic",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`cookies()` or `headers()` opts the route into ==dynamic rendering==",
                "Renders **per request**, not prerendered at build",
                "Request-time APIs: the ==whole route== goes dynamic"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Trigger",
                "Result"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`cookies()` / `headers()`",
                  "{red:dynamic}"
                ],
                [
                  "`searchParams`",
                  "{red:dynamic}"
                ],
                [
                  "`params`, no `generateStaticParams`",
                  "rendered on first request, then cached"
                ],
                [
                  "`fetch` with `no-store`",
                  "{red:dynamic}"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Isolate with Suspense",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "With `cacheComponents`, request APIs outside Suspense ==fail the build==",
                "Wrap only the cookie reader; the rest stays static"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "<Suspense fallback={<Skeleton />}>",
                "  <UserMenu /> {/* reads cookies() */}",
                "</Suspense>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Route Handlers",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`GET` is dynamic only with cookies, headers or the `Request` object",
                "Otherwise it can be prerendered, unless config forces dynamic"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistake",
              "text": "One `cookies()` call in a layout makes **every page** under it dynamic"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
